87} :question/id #uuid "cefebb32-d116-596c-a66e-e8cb8c5a4aa7" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind bases of $S=\\operatorname{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3\\}$ by inspection. **Select every set that is a basis of $S$.**" :question/worked-solution "A **basis** must be linearly independent and span $S$.\n\nAll nonzero vectors point along one direction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{a}_{3}&=(-1)\\mathbf{a}_{1} \\\\ \\mathbf{a}_{2}&=(0)\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvery nonzero singleton is independent and spans $S$. The zero singleton cannot span this nonzero space. Any set of two or three displayed vectors is dependent.\n\nTherefore, select exactly these bases:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal{B}_{1}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{2}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713775 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "861bd745-4900-54e9-bb11-e198ef755851" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713744} {:answer/id #uuid "b9d1293b-ddd7-5cf3-82a3-c781978f1bbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713764}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b9d1293b-ddd7-5cf3-82a3-c781978f1bbd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713764} :answer-field/id #uuid "3da861af-3ed0-5562-9856-0a429ee9b920" :answer-field/key "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713709} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "80ddd162-7842-5d5e-aba