ef 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713734}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "27ff1786-3355-5a15-9d44-247d3fb82c27" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713698} :answer-field/id #uuid "d861f506-3b4d-5029-92c0-e51575d7acd9" :answer-field/key "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713779}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "ecc0abfc-b20c-5c41-b6b4-7a7c6952550a" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n\\mathbf{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\qquad \\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nFind bases of $S=\\operatorname{Span}\\{\\mathbf{a}_1,\\mathbf{a}_2,\\mathbf{a}_3\\}$ by inspection. **Select every set that is a basis of $S$.**" :question/worked-solution "A **basis** must be linearly independent and span $S$.\n\nIf $\\mathbf{a}_{3}=t\\mathbf{a}_{2}$, coordinate $1$ would force $t=1$. But coordinate $2$ would then give $(1)(-1)=-1\\ne 2$. Thus these two nonzero vectors are not parallel and are linearly independent.\n\nChecking the proposed combination gives\n\n$$\n(1)\\mathbf{a}_{2}+(1)\\mathbf{a}_{3}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}=\\mathbf{a}_{1}.\n$$\n\nRemoving $\\mathbf{a}_{1}$ leaves the span unchanged. Both coefficients are nonzero. Each of the three pairs is independent: if the combination were parallel to either original direction, the nonzero coefficient of the other independent direction would have to vanish. Each pair also recovers the omitted vector by rearranging the displayed relation. No singleton spans the two independent directions, and the triple is dependent.\n\nTherefore, select exactly these bases:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathcal{B}_{1}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{2}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{1},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\} \\\\ \\mathcal{B}_{3}&=\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186713861 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4139ebcf-bbb8-570c-b161-6dbf1f6a188a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713846} {:answer/id #uuid "dfc45890-ca19-55f3-9824-475fe5113a8f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713893}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4139ebcf-bbb8-570c-b161-6dbf1f6a188a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713846} :answer-field/id #uuid "370cf9f3-55af-51a0-8bd2-84abacd2f776" :answer-field/key "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2},\\mathbf{a}_{3}\\}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713841} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5e489eb1-cde4-5afa-8527-b21ea642baad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713857} {:answer/id #uuid "8cf7a460-d595-520b-a254-724652f0b378" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713871}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5e489eb1-cde4-5afa-8527-b21ea642baad" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713857} :answer-field/id #uuid "42e52fbc-a37e-500a-9389-ac89d8e60630" :answer-field/key "$\\{\\mathbf{a}_{2}\\}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186713847} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1a8ecad3-fc7a-52f1-aea8-105de7a01845" :a